# ── FORMATO: detalle (detalle) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2 tomas de 345 frames (14,4 s) = 29 s. Ancladas, no encadenadas.
# 736x416 porque a 512x288 el modelo produce aberraciones de color (12 medidas).
#
@TIPO detalle
@ESCENA Weathered hands with prominent veins and short clean nails resting on an open hardback book on a dark polished wooden table, a warm desk lamp raking from the left, the page edges catching the light.
@AMBIENTE A quiet room tone with the faint hum of a distant street beyond the window, and the soft creak of old wood.
@MUSICA A sparse low sustained cello note held quietly, restrained and continuous, unchanging in character.

TOMA|One hand slowly turns a single page, the paper lifting and settling. The other hand stays still.|inicio|
TOMA|A fingertip traces slowly down the page, stops, and lifts away.|ancla|
